{"id": "14-1347-6-8", "zh": "rañño santakaṃ（国王的财物）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1348-2-10", "zh": "138,121．在 smiṃ 格尾时作 raññe、rājini。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1349-2-12", "zh": "整个 rāja 一词连同格尾，在 smiṃ 格尾时替换为 raññe、rājini。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1350-2-7", "zh": "raññe，rājini sīlaṃ tiṭṭhati（戒德安住于国王）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-1351-2-10", "zh": "139,245．tumha、amha 作 tayi、mayi。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "14-1352-2-16", "zh": "所有 tumha、amha 二词连同格尾，在 smiṃ 格尾时依次替换为 tayi、mayi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1353-2-5", "zh": "tayi，mayi。", "confidence": 90}
