{"id": "14-1354-6-11", "zh": "tvaṃ bhavasi（你存在），ahaṃ bhavāmi（我存在）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1355-2-10", "zh": "140,232．在 si 格尾时也作 tvaṃ、ahaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1356-2-16", "zh": "所有 tumha、amha 二词连同格尾，在 si 格尾时依次替换为 tvaṃ、ahaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1357-2-5", "zh": "tvaṃ，ahaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
