{"id": "14-1358-6-9", "zh": "tayi，mayi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1359-2-6", "zh": "由于用了 ca 字，也有 tuvaṃ 这一形式。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1359-7-9", "zh": "tuvaṃ satthā（你是导师）。", "confidence": 75}
